    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d753">

                <pb facs="0791" n="779" xml:id="pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.796/896: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-05-22T17:00:00-04:00">May 22, 1942—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1309. Your 1720, May 20, 9 p.m. and Department’s 1242 and 1268.<anchor n="9"
                        xml:id="d753-f1"/> We assume that you will not recommend the deletion of
                    Condor or despatch of technicians until you are satisfied that ties between
                    Condor and Lufthansa have been cut. We are making every effort to hold the
                    technicians, and await your reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
